{"page":430,"verses":[{"verse_key":"34:15","surah":34,"ayah":15,"ar_uthmani":"لَقَدْ كَانَ لِسَبَإٍ فِى مَسْكَنِهِمْ ءَايَةٌ ۖ جَنَّتَانِ عَن يَمِينٍ وَشِمَالٍ ۖ كُلُوا۟ مِن رِّزْقِ رَبِّكُمْ وَٱشْكُرُوا۟ لَهُۥ ۚ بَلْدَةٌ طَيِّبَةٌ وَرَبٌّ غَفُورٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"There was a sign for the people of Sheba, too, in their dwelling place: two gardens, one on the right, one on the left: ‘Eat from what your Lord has provided for you and give Him thanks, for your land is good, and your Lord most forgiving.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"لَقَدْ","en_gloss":"Certainly","transliteration":"laqad","verse_key":"34:15"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"(there) was","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"34:15"},{"pos":3,"ar":"لِسَبَإٍۢ","en_gloss":"for Saba","transliteration":"lisaba-in","verse_key":"34:15"},{"pos":4,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"34:15"},{"pos":5,"ar":"مَسْكَنِهِمْ","en_gloss":"their dwelling place","transliteration":"maskanihim","verse_key":"34:15"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ءَايَةٌۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"a sign:","transliteration":"āyatun","verse_key":"34:15"},{"pos":7,"ar":"جَنَّتَانِ","en_gloss":"Two gardens","transliteration":"jannatāni","verse_key":"34:15"},{"pos":8,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"on","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"34:15"},{"pos":9,"ar":"يَمِينٍۢ","en_gloss":"(the) right","transliteration":"yamīnin","verse_key":"34:15"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَشِمَالٍۢ ۖ","en_gloss":"and (on the) left","transliteration":"washimālin","verse_key":"34:15"},{"pos":11,"ar":"كُلُوا۟","en_gloss":"Eat","transliteration":"kulū","verse_key":"34:15"},{"pos":12,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"34:15"},{"pos":13,"ar":"رِّزْقِ","en_gloss":"(the) provision","transliteration":"riz'qi","verse_key":"34:15"},{"pos":14,"ar":"رَبِّكُمْ","en_gloss":"(of) your Lord","transliteration":"rabbikum","verse_key":"34:15"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَٱشْكُرُوا۟","en_gloss":"and be grateful","transliteration":"wa-ush'kurū","verse_key":"34:15"},{"pos":1